# Play test of Glasshouse Gardens (CIPlay glasshouse_gardens, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The plateau's top at 23.6 m: the gate at 4 -44 (the road's top; it slants up the cliff from -30 -61 to 8 -45), the cottage
# x 9..15, z -35.5..-26.5 (door south at x 9..12); the potting shed x 41.5..50.5, z 4.5..10.5 (door west); the Orchid house
# x -6..6, z 30..39 (door south at x -6..-3); the Palm house x -31.5..-22.5, z -1..5 (door east, the gantry at 28.15 m along
# its west wall, ladders at -29.55 0.5); the Lily house x 26.5..35.5, z 28.5..34.5 (door west at z 31.5..34.5); the Great
# House x -6..6, z -9..9 (door south at x -6..-3).
island Glasshouse Gardens
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Titan Blooms
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at -32 -63 h=3
walk -30 -61 to -11 -53 h=14.6
walk -11 -53 to 8 -45 h=23.6
walk 8 -45 to 4 -42 h=23.6
zone gardengate
expect step 1
walk 4 -42 to 10.5 -38 to 10.5 -33 h=23.65
read Professor Lind's journal
expect step 2
open Lind's legacy
expect message FOR WHOEVER SEES IT BLOOM
at 38 9 h=24.6
walk 38 9 to 44 9 h=23.65
zone pottingshed
expect message Beetles
kill Roach
expect step 3
open Potting shed chest
expect story brush 1
expect step 4
use orchid
expect message opens only in mist
use mistvalve
expect shown mist
use orchid
expect story pollen 1
expect step 5
at -20 0.5 h=24.6
walk -20 0.5 to -28 0.5 h=23.65
at -29 0.5 h=29.2
zone gantry
use palmspike
expect story pollen 2
expect step 6
at 24 33 h=24.6
walk 24 33 to 29 33 h=23.65
use nightlily
expect message opens only in the dark
use blindlever
expect shown lilydark
use nightlily
expect story pollen 3
expect step 7
at -4.5 -12 h=24.6
walk -4.5 -12 to -4.5 -6 to 0 -1 h=23.65
zone greathouse
expect step 8
use titanbud
expect shown titanbloom
expect story titanseed 1
expect step 9
open Lind's legacy
expect done
open Barrow box
open Cove barrel
open Sunk crate of pots
# Raft's story machinery: Lind's seed chest stays sun-locked until both mirrors are turned
open Lind's seed chest
expect message wants the light of both mirrors
use sunmirror1
expect message quarter turn
open Lind's seed chest
expect message wants the light of both mirrors
use sunmirror2
open Lind's seed chest
expect item Seed_Flower_Red 3
